---
title: Sequence 3 - PUT /api/patients/{id} (Update Patient)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client as Admin/Doctor Client
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant MW as Auth + Role Middleware
    participant Policy as PatientPolicy
    participant Request as UpdatePatientRequest
    participant Service as PatientService
    participant DB as Database

    Client->>API: PUT /api/patients/{id} {updated fields}
    API->>MW: Verify Sanctum token
    MW-->>API: Authenticated (admin or doktor)
    API->>Policy: authorize('update', patient)
    alt pacijent attempts update
        Policy-->>API: Denied
        API-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    else admin or doktor
        Policy-->>API: Allowed
        API->>Request: Validate request data
        alt Validation fails
            Request-->>API: Validation errors
            API-->>Client: 422 Unprocessable Entity
        else Validation passes
            Request-->>API: Validated data
            API->>Service: updatePatient(patient, validatedData)
            Service->>DB: UPDATE patients SET ...
            DB-->>Service: Updated patient
            Service-->>API: Patient
            API-->>Client: 200 PatientResource JSON
        end
    end
